  {
    "id": "C4",
    "weakest_point": "After a terrifying mid-ad peak, it cuts to a repetitive second act and ends on a static wide shot after Juliana gives permission to burn the book, deflating the tension it built.",
    "hook": {
      "score": 5,
      "reason": "It opens on the hiss of a mother's book burning plus the cruel line 'This pathetic book is the only thing you still have from your mother' — instant, context-free cruelty that needs no setup."
    },
    "cliffhanger": {
      "score": 2,
      "reason": "The final beat is a wide shot after Juliana says 'Burn it,' which resolves the immediate question; the iron-to-eye cliffhanger is buried at 22 s, not at the end."
